{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】警方在尖沙咀截查一輛可疑私家車，司機涉嫌藥後駕駛及管有危險藥物等罪被捕。</p><p>被捕36歲男司機被押到私家車旁邊調查，緝毒犬亦到場協助搜證。周日晚上十時左右，警方在麼地道近碧仙桃路發現一輛可疑私家車，於是截停搜查，在車內發現懷疑毒品，當場拘捕司機。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T23:38:41.676374+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T23:19:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T00:28:32.418767+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T23:37:34.969386+00:00","content_hash":"c9f2a9fadf865b65098941373e4d136529fb00cc25066e04e9ab996d6f20b697","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}